	(text "Power (D-73, D-81, D-82, C-25): 13.8 V in, 500 mA fuse, SS34 reverse-polarity diode, SMBJ16A TVS.\n+13V8 feeds the four loop current sources (link sheet). L7805CV on the housing wall (tab = GND, insulating pad) gives +5V.\nLD1117S33 gives +3V3 for the DevKit, the logic and the PhotoMOS LEDs. No switch-mode converter (D-73).\nBudget about 130 mA at 5 V and 115 mA at 3.3 V. Heat: 7805 about 1.2 W, LD1117 about 0.2 W (C-25); 11 to 15 V input checked (C-34).\nR5, R6 0R: lift to measure the 5 V and 3.3 V loads; F1 serves for +13V8. Test points TP1 to TP3 (D-120).\nExceptions (D-124): SMBJ16A at 15 V max (0.94); L7805 capacitors 330 nF in, 100 nF out per the ST datasheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 88.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
